{"id": "opengov-permitting-software-waiver", "title": "San Francisco selected its permitting software without comparable price bids", "seconds": 45.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "0ba43c17e600572e", "words": 115, "beats": [{"scene": "s", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Fifty vendors answered San Francisco’s search for permitting software.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.71, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["How", "were", "prices", "compared?"], "sub": "San Francisco permitting software"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.83, 1.23, 1.4, 2.02, 2.27, 2.42, 2.86]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Fifteen gave presentations. Three finalists went through user testing.", "t0": 3.83, "t1": 8.38, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "15 presentations", "label": "3 finalists tested"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.79, 1.88, 2.54, 3.15, 3.31, 3.58, 3.91]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The City selected OpenGov using a proprietary software waiver.", "t0": 8.5, "t1": 12.34, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "waiver", "kicker": "Purchasing authority", "text": "Software waiver", "mark": "waiver"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.37, 0.88, 1.49, 1.8, 1.9, 2.61, 3.11]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The first contract was for one year and $5.9 million.", "t0": 12.46, "t1": 16.33, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5.9 million", "label": "Original agreement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.36, 0.82, 1.0, 1.22, 1.42, 1.76, 1.89, 2.21, 2.57, 2.75, 3.17]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Finalists never priced the same work. Staff lacked comparable prices.", "t0": 16.55, "t1": 21.43, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "june-analysis", "kicker": "June analysis", "text": "Comparable prices", "mark": "prices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.78, 1.14, 1.26, 1.6, 2.27, 3.26, 3.64, 4.18]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The analysts found no evidence of unfair treatment.", "t0": 21.55, "t1": 24.53, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "june-analysis", "kicker": "Analyst finding", "text": "City rules permitted the selection", "mark": "selection"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.6, 0.91, 1.18, 1.76, 1.99, 2.44]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The analyst later counted $1.33 million paid in professional services fees.", "t0": 24.65, "t1": 29.92, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1.33 million", "label": "Pilot services fees paid"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.45, 0.77, 1.23, 1.43, 1.86, 2.04, 2.38, 2.93, 3.4, 3.64, 3.79, 4.29, 4.87]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Board cut the proposed ceiling and shortened the term.", "t0": 30.14, "t1": 33.3, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "signed", "kicker": "Final resolution", "text": "September 2029", "mark": "2029"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.42, 0.62, 0.74, 1.22, 1.74, 2.08, 2.46, 2.62]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Supervisors authorized about $28 million. The measure passed ten to one.", "t0": 33.42, "t1": 38.37, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$28 million", "label": "Authorized ceiling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.67, 1.16, 1.47, 1.86, 2.22, 3.28, 3.38, 3.72, 4.14, 4.46, 4.68]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "City records show permits were being issued through the new system.", "t0": 38.49, "t1": 41.49, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "issued-aggregate", "kicker": "City permitting data", "text": "Issued permits", "mark": "permits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.59, 0.77, 1.15, 1.31, 1.5, 1.86, 2.02, 2.12, 2.32]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 41.61, "t1": 44.16, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.71, 0.92, 1.25, 1.37, 1.5, 1.82, 2.14]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"s": "Selecting the software", "r": "Comparing the terms", "v": "The vote and the rollout"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "person"}